   SSttaannddoouutt
       The  routine  ssttaannddoouutt  is the same as aattttrroonn((AA__SSTTAANNDDOOUUTT)).  The routine
       ssttaannddeenndd is the same as aattttrrsseett((AA__NNOORRMMAALL)) or aattttrrsseett((00)),  that  is,  it
